    "description": "Waterfall Fountain Indoor: Elevate your space with Midwest Tropical's stunning fountains for beauty, wellness, and Feng Shui harmony this festive season!",
    "articleBody": "Having a waterfall fountain indoor brings a feeling of well-being and freshness. Does waterfall feature contribute according to Feng Shui? Which waterfall features or waterfall fountain wall should have and where to install them?         Waterfall fountain indoor - can do a lot.        Beyond any theory, having waterfall features brings a feeling of well-being and freshness. In seasons of high temperatures, a waterfall fountain indoor offers well-being which is multiplied by the sound of running water.        Why waterfall fountain in Feng Shui    For Feng Shui, water is a purifying element par excellence that circulates vital energy when it runs as in fountains. As we know Feng Shui is an ancient Chinese technique that harmonizes the relationship between people and objects. Experts recommend having waterfall floor fountains or any waterfall features only where we are willing to attend to them.        It is advisable to put a waterfall fountain in places of socialization, such as entrances, living rooms, and workspaces. Suppose we are convinced that we have enough enthusiasm to enjoy the energy provided by the waterfall fountain wall. In that case, experts advise us to always place waterfall feature wall in places of socialization. At the same time, they advise against putting a waterfall fountain in bathrooms.        A waterfall feature wall to lure the guests    Suppose we choose the exterior, whether in gardens, terraces, or balconies. In that case, we recommend looking for the \"prosperity corner,\" which is found in the following way according to Feng Shui: When going outside, from the door, look at the bottom and the left, since that is the ideal corner.        Which waterfall feature to choose    Regarding the characteristics, the specialists warn that waterfall feature must be of an appropriate size to the place where they are to be placed and that. When buying waterfall fountain wall, we must take care that the sound of the engine does not cover the noise of the waterfall.        The Feng Shui warns that there are two sources: the Yin, which is passive and relaxing, and the Yan, which is active and energizing. The fountains with lights, rotating glass balls and tall waterfall fountain indoor are of the Yan type. On the other hand, the low fountains such as waterfall fireplace indoor with horizontal objects, plants or Buddhas, are of the Yin type and are intended to provide tranquility.        To make a better choice, it is good to take a visual walk through the hundreds of waterfall fountain models that can be seen on Midwest Tropical. The website is dedicated exclusively to waterfall features.        Tables and waterfall features    The standing waterfall features about 40 cm high. If the waterfall feature is lower, it is better to place it on a different level: on a table, cupboard, shelf, window sill. If the waterfall fountain is narrow and elongated, you can put a tall flower vase with compositions of branches, herbs, dried flowers, bamboo, etc.\u0026nbsp; In addition to flowers, branches, grasses, and twigs, artificial or real, the waterfall fountain is decorated with LED garlands.        In general, if a waterfall fountain is beautiful, it is self-sufficient, so there is no need to put anything in it. This is optional.        Create a festive atmosphere with waterfall fountain indoor    Waterfall fountain indoor are traditionally decorative before the holidays. Regardless of the occasion, waterfall fountain for Christmas decorations bring a festive atmosphere to the interior and animates it        The festive atmosphere is always appropriate, and not only on the eve of celebrations. Waterfall fountain indoor is worth decorating for no reason. A beautiful waterfall feature in the center of the hall, with flowers, branches, or even empty, is a great room decoration. The decorated area stands out from the available space.",
